      "SourceElementId": "G11-U03-L17-ACTIVITY-021",
      "SourceSection": "17.4: Can You See the Solutions on a Graph?",
      "SourceExcerpt": "Sometimes quadratic equations have real solutions, and sometimes they do not. Here is a quadratic equation with \\(x^2\\) equal to a negative number (assume \\(k\\) is positive):",
