    },
    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U03-L17-ACTIVITY-023",
      "SourceSection": "17.4: Can You See the Solutions on a Graph?",
      "SourceExcerpt": "This equation will have imaginary solutions \\(i\\sqrt{k}\\) and \\(\\text-i\\sqrt{k}\\). By similar reasoning, an equation of the form:",
