      "SourceSection": "17.4: Can You See the Solutions on a Graph?",
      "SourceExcerpt": "\\(\\displaystyle \\begin{align} x^2 - 12x + 36 + 5 &= 0 \\\\ (x - 6)^2 + 5 &= 0 \\\\ (x - 6)^2 &= \\text- 5 \\\\ x-6 &= \\pm i \\sqrt{5} \\\\ x &= 6 \\pm i \\sqrt{5} \\end{align}\\)",
